          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚨 AI JOBS UPDATE – Oct 10, 2026\n\nLooking for your next opportunity in AI? Here are some current AI/ML openings you can explore today 👇\n\n🔹 1. Junior Software Engineer – Fresher AI/ML\n🏢 Company: iCloud EMS | 📍 Remote | 💼 0–1 Yr | 🛠️ Python, AI/ML, GenAI, LLM, PyTorch\n🔗 https://lnkd.in/eFPHqV8a\n\n🔹 2. ML Engineer\n🏢 Company: Leegality | 📍 Remote | 💼 3–5 Yrs | 🛠️ ML, Python, PyTorch, CV, NLP\n🔗 https://lnkd.in/ev7ftMsE\n\n🔹 3. AI/ML Intern\n🏢 Company: LetsIntern | 📍 Remote | 💼 Fresher | 🛠️ Python, ML, Data Science\n🔗 https://lnkd.in/eQE5CAki\n\n🔹 4. GenAI Developer\n🏢 Company: RecruitBots AI | 📍 Remote | 💼 0–2 Yrs | 🛠️ ML, AI, GenAI Tools\n💰 ₹3L - 8L/yr | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/eV29mn_6\n\n🔹 5. AI Engineer\n🏢 Company: Krutrim Insights | 📍 Delhi | 💼 Fresher | 🛠️ Python, AI Fundamentals\n💰 ₹3L - 5.4L/yr | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/ej-pbmTZ\n\n🔹 6. AI/ML Trainee | GenAI\n🏢 Company: WINIT | 📍 Hyderabad | 💼 0–2 Yrs | 🛠️ Python, SQL, AWS, GenAI\n💰 ₹2L - 3L/yr | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/eTfu9-3p\n\n🔹 7. AI Associate\n🏢 Company: Advance Agility | 📍 Remote | 💼 Fresher | 🛠️ ChatGPT, Claude, Prompt Engineering\n💰 ₹2.4L - 4.2L/yr | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/efEgnpnn\n\n🔹 8. Data Scientist\n🏢 Company: Digitwin Technology | 📍 Chennai | 💼 Fresher | 🛠️ Python, ML, Data Analysis\n💰 ₹3L - 6L/yr | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/e_UqCpDG\n\n🔹 9. Computer Vision Trainee\n🏢 Company: Miracle Eye Pvt Ltd | 📍 Remote | 💼 Fresher | 🛠️ OpenCV, Python, CV\n💰 ₹2L/yr | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/e5VHhK78\n\n🔹 10. AI/ML Intern\n🏢 Company: WeIntern Pvt Ltd | 📍 Remote/Pune | 💼 Fresher | 🛠️ Python, ML, Data Science\n💰 ₹10K - 20K/month | 🔗 https://lnkd.in/e3XztRbZ\n\n💡 Career Tip: Apply early, tailor your resume to the job description, and keep your LinkedIn profile updated. Highlight your projects and practical experience with AI/ML tools.\n\n🔔 Follow for daily AI job updates, career opportunities, and AI industry news.\n\n#AIJobs #ArtificialIntelligence #MachineLearning #DataScience #AIJobsIndia #TechJobs #FreshersJobs #Jobs #Career #Hiring #GenAI #DeepLearning #NLP #ComputerVision",
